{"4454930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Undead Defense TD", "steam_appid": 4454930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Zombies are coming!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build your defenses and expand your settlement to create a safe space for humanity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/fdb743d09bee0aa519aa6f0d15019bb1.poster.avif?t=1783454890\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/fdb743d09bee0aa519aa6f0d15019bb1.webm?t=1783454890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/fdb743d09bee0aa519aa6f0d15019bb1.mp4?t=1783454890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use turrets, walls and light towers to keep the darkness safe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/5d40581a4533f619666fc6180569d95b.poster.avif?t=1783454890\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/5d40581a4533f619666fc6180569d95b.webm?t=1783454890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/5d40581a4533f619666fc6180569d95b.mp4?t=1783454890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Expand your settlement to find abandoned settlements and additional resources.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/4db5bdaa932d5e6ede57398d32f1d006.poster.avif?t=1783454890\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/4db5bdaa932d5e6ede57398d32f1d006.webm?t=1783454890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/4db5bdaa932d5e6ede57398d32f1d006.mp4?t=1783454890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A tower defense game, where towers are important for both lighting the darkness and killing the hordes of the dead for good. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend resources to place buildings and to upgrade them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light up the darkness to find lost settlements for extra resources new weapon types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand to fast and risk spreading yourself too thin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of stronger and stronger enemies will come at you to test your defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last hope for humanity, rebuild a safe place to allow life to thrive.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Zombies are coming!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build your defenses and expand your settlement to create a safe space for humanity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/fdb743d09bee0aa519aa6f0d15019bb1.poster.avif?t=1783454890\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/fdb743d09bee0aa519aa6f0d15019bb1.webm?t=1783454890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/fdb743d09bee0aa519aa6f0d15019bb1.mp4?t=1783454890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use turrets, walls and light towers to keep the darkness safe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/5d40581a4533f619666fc6180569d95b.poster.avif?t=1783454890\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/5d40581a4533f619666fc6180569d95b.webm?t=1783454890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/5d40581a4533f619666fc6180569d95b.mp4?t=1783454890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Expand your settlement to find abandoned settlements and additional resources.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/4db5bdaa932d5e6ede57398d32f1d006.poster.avif?t=1783454890\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/4db5bdaa932d5e6ede57398d32f1d006.webm?t=1783454890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/extras/4db5bdaa932d5e6ede57398d32f1d006.mp4?t=1783454890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A tower defense game, where towers are important for both lighting the darkness and killing the hordes of the dead for good. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend resources to place buildings and to upgrade them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light up the darkness to find lost settlements for extra resources new weapon types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand to fast and risk spreading yourself too thin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of stronger and stronger enemies will come at you to test your defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last hope for humanity, rebuild a safe place to allow life to thrive.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Zombies are coming! Build your defenses and expand your settlement to create a safe space for humanity. Use turrets, walls and light towers to keep the darkness safe. Expand your settlement to find abandoned settlements and additional resources.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/19c35185f329cd8b248c4c418efdea27dcf7f230/header.jpg?t=1783454890", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/3e959e627415a020c01285c7edc254eb0270a281/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783454890", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454930/3e959e627415a020c01285c7edc254eb0270a281/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783454890", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-3570 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050Ti or AMD Radeon<br></li><li